                      "type": "html",
                      "html": "<p>The C4AI supports a range of scientific diffusion and knowledge dissemination activities, organizing and supporting scientific meetings and events, and promoting the AI knowledge dissemination among researchers and to the society in general. Activities also include working with press and media, scientific journalists, and with the general public through social media sites.</p>"
